From c7e56d539905d4b8566361165477f8537f7dcc92 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alona Solntseva <alona.solntseva@tandemg.com>
Date: Wed, 09 Feb 2022 18:27:08 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-67906] erom recovery: port api of preboot main

Call erom recovery API's directly instead of calling preboot main
function
Preboot main function ported partially: only recovery related API's

Change-Id: I50c9b479531d6b5e34758bcb054c78e2f3a233f5
Signed-off-by: Alona Solntseva <alona.solntseva@tandemg.com>
---

